# Shattering Stars (jeuno 132) accepted (a GM) by level 66 chars of the jobs Horlais Peak serves (the Warrior's is the main flow's): BLM (4), RNG (11),
# one char each (main the first). Each trades its job's testimony (64 with its job id) and answers 1: tradedTestimony
# 1, set down at Horlais Peak (-511.459 159.004 -210.543, zone 139); the char zones at the next tick.
# Then each char, in the flow's order, enters its own Maat fight in its own area (1, 2, 3: the fights of one zone
# run side by side): a GM warp by BC_Entrance (the flow parser follows zones by warp), the testimony traded (the 32000
# menu), 32000 updated with option index * 16 + area (registered, entered; the testimony wears), finished; that
# area's Maat "killed" (unkillable: 1 HP; he yields, battlefield:win, at a later onMobFight, so some kills take ticks
# before the 32001 opens; battlefieldWin the fight's id), and the win's 32001 finished: accepted, so a Scroll of
# Instant Warp, Prog = the job id, the job's maatsCap bit (1 << (job - 1): a fresh char's maatsCap is 0), Maat Masher.
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/64 HorlaisPeak/BC_Entrance/onTrade HorlaisPeak/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=BLM lvl=66
char rng zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=RNG lvl=66
levelcap 70
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
item BlackMagesTestimony
rng: levelcap 70
rng: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
rng: item RangersTestimony
login
trade Maat BlackMagesTestimony x1       # BLM's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (4)
finish option=1                         # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Horlais Peak
tick 400
login                                   # in Horlais Peak
rng: login
rng: trade Maat RangersTestimony x1     # RNG's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (11)
rng: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Horlais Peak
tick 400
rng: login                              # in Horlais Peak
warp -501.5,158.3,-212.6 HorlaisPeak    # by BC_Entrance
trade BC_Entrance BlackMagesTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=97                  # Shattering Stars (BLM), index 6, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
kill MAAT+3                             # Maat (BLM) of area 1: 1 HP (unkillable), won once he yields, battlefieldWin 6
tick 1000                               # Maat is unkillable: he yields (battlefield:win) in a later onMobFight; 32001 opens on the last tick
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
finish                                  # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 4, maatsCap 8, Maat Masher
rng: warp -501.5,158.3,-212.6 HorlaisPeak  # by BC_Entrance
rng: trade BC_Entrance RangersTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
rng: update 32000 option=114            # Shattering Stars (RNG), index 7, area 2: registered, entered
rng: finish                             # in the arena
rng: kill MAAT+7                        # Maat (RNG) of area 2: won, battlefieldWin 7, 32001 opens
rng: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 11, maatsCap 1024, Maat Masher
